{
  "id": "JHN.14",
  "number": "14",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Yohana 14",
  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu naweeda weah heeda Bwaabwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adiidu gwahirbaban jeesingeagwa, amwasa ASEETA, ak ghoamwaschaan eara aniini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gheeda Bwaabeedeanyu gwanda giibinda haw, gwachi inyeeda ea masnu gajea neabay darukuneegwa asi ghamneawa geawi dasinneegwa hoorgeedeang'wa jea oopiidana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iyeawi ak geasinneegwa hoorgeedeang'wa, gaydabiigu gicha ak ghaayaacheegwa heedeandi, abeeda heedeandi aniini eara agooga gajandana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoanali naweeda gal heeda eagali.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoanyaash Domaso niny, “Ng'utamiida, aseasa meanali heeda iigali; abeeda gajeanaldaan naweeda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu niny, “Aniini geawooschi naweeda, ea huumeanda, ea eaweega; siida moamu gawa heeda Bwaabwa, geaghus gwasku heedeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyeeda ghwanyawa ghoanalaan, gajanala eara Bwaabwa, ghang'eada ghamneawa ghoanali ak ea noadaayi niny.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Filipo niny, “Ng'utamiida, ahiimneasa Bwaabwa ghoahiideasa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu niny, “Geendeaydooschi sea agooga ea gooyang'u ak ea minalaani Filipo? Siida nidaahan aniini nidaah Bwaabwa; abeeda giimuustiin gideaba giyeeni, ‘Ahiimneasa Bwaabwa’? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumwasi gideaba aniini geandi jeeda Bwaabwa nea Bwaabwa gwanda jeedeanyu? Ng'asheega earukuneegwean mearukunani gheambalmeedeanyu aniini, gwasin Bwaabeeda mida jeedeanyu gadiyoojigaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amwasa gideaba aniini geandi jeeda Bwaabwa, nea gwanda Bwaabwa jeedeanyu; ghoamwaschaan aba gadiyoojiga easinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba huumwa, aba huumwa, geayeeshiineegwa, siida mwasan gaygwasin gadiyoojusu easinyi aniiniin; asi gaygwasin eara gadiyoojiga hees muuchi, aba gideaba aniini geawi heeda Bwaabwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gida wassean oomuschi aba gheawungeasu gaydasin, ak abeeda geakghambiit Bwaabwa aba badayda Orjeeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyoomuschi gida wassean aba gheawungeasu gaydasineegwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Heeleesiinda Guroorooda Ghaydit",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iyoabwariinyaan gajoang'waanya diigheanyeekeasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydamwaash Bwaabwa ak gaygagoneegwa Weedaneeda nuut, jea andeayeewana damanda manda muudeanooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niny Gurooroodida bea huumwaan nea fuga ng'eanyiida ea moamu ghwadeapta aba gideaba moamu ghwadaah ghana ghwanal; agooga ghoanali niny aba gideaba gajandeawana nea gwanda jeedeang'wa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Maydanung'useegwa heeda bananga; gaydahidu heedeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sinung' gilimwanang' ak ea maygudu ghwadaahan ng'eanyiida, duuku agooga gajadaahaan; aba gideaba aniini geawooschi majeek, abeeda eara agooga gajawoosa majeekcheewi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweedida gajanala gideaba aniini geandi jeeda Bwaabwa, nea goondi agooga jeedeanyu, nea geandi aniini jeedeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida mideawa diigheanyeekeasu nea ghoang'waay, nih dea bwariinyan gil, nea dea bwariinyan gayghabwariiy Bwaabwa, gaydabwariiy ak gaydeahiimsa geaw niny.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Yudayda (mawoosa dea Iskariyote,) “Ng'utamiida, gayghoawataan gideaba gajahiimneasa geaw nea miihiimsiini geaw ng'eanyiida?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Siida iibwariinyan gayghoang'waay ng'asheandeanyu, nea abeeda Bwaabwa gayghabwariiy siisi, ak gajeapkaana aseasa headaanyi ak geepiidi headaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida mabwariinyan mayghoang'waay ng'asheegeasu; nea ng'asheanda oayiinyi ea mii deanyu gil gaba Bwaabeeda ajeaknean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'asheesu gearukuneegwa, nea abeeda ea gudeendeayeena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Weedaneeni, was Guroorooda Ghaydit jea goojeagu Bwaabwa aba gheawungeasuun, gayghoanaaleagwa haleanjeeda sean, nea goopkeaneegwa ng'asheega sean earukuneegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydanung'uneegwa hoyyoo, geagonyeegwa hoyyooydeanyu; maydagoondaneegwa gidagooniida ng'eanyiida. Asi adagwasawana gurooruunatkeagwa, nea adaghang'udeagwa muuwda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghayi noayiinyi nea geayeeshiineegwa, ‘Neawi heechea dawa, ama muchu gaydabiigu gicha heedeang'wa.’ Inyeeda ghoabwariinyaan, gwachi gajahoosana aba gideaba geawi heeda Bwaabwa; aba gideaba niny ea haweewaneani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheesu geabay darukuneegwa ghamneawa heeda mii ghwahina, ama eaweeda hina abeeda ghoamwaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
